package ir.techima.kardan

/**
 * Full topic set (spec 4.3) for every target messenger: send, groups/channels, notifications,
 * privacy, block/report, recovery + common problems, suspicious messages.
 * Menu names are only given where they are well known (Telegram, WhatsApp); for the others the
 * guide says to use the app's own settings search instead of inventing menu paths.
 */
